L35_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_OPR_GRACE"
L36_1 = "Grace, la Guide stellaire de l\226\128\153Empire d'Arcadena est l'h\195\169riti\195\168re du comte de Birmingham. Elle provient d\226\128\153une famille prestigieuse qui a contribu\195\169 au salut de l\226\128\153Empire en cr\195\169ant de nombreuses armes uniques, et son talent exceptionnel d\195\168s son plus jeune \195\162ge lui a permis de jouer un r\195\180le cl\195\169 en tant que conseill\195\168re de l\226\128\153Empire. Son caract\195\168re exceptionnel et son d\195\169vouement lui valent la confiance du peuple et de ses subordonn\195\169s, mais ses actions impr\195\169vues, bien qu\226\128\153innocentes, font d\226\128\153elle une personne \195\160 surveiller au sein de l\226\128\153Empire.\nEn particulier, comme elle a l\226\128\153habitude de danser le flamenco avec passion, une surveillance rigoureuse est requise lors des bals imp\195\169riaux."
L34_1[1] = L35_1
L34_1[2] = L36_1
L35_1 = {}
L36_1 = "SI_SKILL_NAME_OPR_GRACE"
L37_1 = "Gloria Asterism"
L35_1[1] = L36_1
L35_1[2] = L37_1
L36_1 = {}
L37_1 = "SI_SKILL_DESC_OPR_GRACE"
L38_1 = "Inflige l'effet <color=#ffd34c>AMP DGT subis +{value1} %</color> \195\160 <color=#ffd34c>tous les ennemis</color> pendant <color=#ffd34c>{time}\194\160s</color> (\195\160 l'exception des boss). Cet effet <color=#ffd34c>ne peut pas \195\170tre annul\195\169</color>. Et [#UNIT_OPR_GRACE_SUMMON#] \195\160 proximit\195\169 du vaisseau alli\195\169, inflige des <color=#ffd34c>d\195\169g\195\162ts de zone de comp\195\169tence ultime</color> sur tout le champ de bataille. (3 coups valides, n'inflige pas de d\195\169g\195\162ts aux vaisseaux en comp\195\169tition). Lorsque des d\195\169g\195\162ts de zone sont inflig\195\169s, <color=#ffd34c>AMP DGT +{value2} %</color> la premi\195\168re fois, et est <color=#ffd34c>multipli\195\169 par 2</color> \195\160 chaque activation. (96 % max)."
L36_1[1] = L37_1
L36_1[2] = L38_1
L37_1 = {}
L38_1 = "SI_DP_KEYWORD_DESC_UNIT_OPR_GRACE_SUMMON"
L39_1 = "Statistique de base (JcE / JcJ)\nATQ : 12000 / 2400\nCRIT : 900 / 900\nPRC : 900 / 900\nN'est pas affect\195\169e par les autres unit\195\169s, op\195\169rateurs."
L37_1[1] = L38_1
L37_1[2] = L39_1
L38_1 = {}
L39_1 = "SI_DP_KEYWORD_NAME_UNIT_OPR_GRACE_SUMMON"
L40_1 = "Allen Birmingham"
L38_1[1] = L39_1
L38_1[2] = L40_1
L39_1 = {}
L40_1 = "AB_UI_UNIT_VOICE_OPR_GRACE@AB_UI_UNIT_VOICE_OPR_GRACE_GET_01"
L41_1 = "As time flows on and the stars align, even if our destinations differ, we must stand united. In the name of Grace Birmingham, Guide of the Empire, I offer you the star's tribute, Sage."
L39_1[1] = L40_1
L39_1[2] = L41_1
L40_1 = {}
L41_1 = "AB_UI_UNIT_VOICE_OPR_GRACE@AB_UI_UNIT_VOICE_OPR_GRACE_LOBBY_CAPTAIN"
L42_1 = "Conflict naturally subsides in the presence of a wise ruler."
L40_1[1] = L41_1
L40_1[2] = L42_1
L41_1 = {}
L42_1 = "AB_UI_UNIT_VOICE_OPR_GRACE@AB_UI_UNIT_VOICE_OPR_GRACE_LOBBY_CONNECT"
L43_1 = "Your return has made the waiting worthwhile."
L41_1[1] = L42_1
L41_1[2] = L43_1
L42_1 = {}
L43_1 = "AB_UI_UNIT_VOICE_OPR_GRACE@AB_UI_UNIT_VOICE_OPR_GRACE_LOBBY_TOUCH_NORMAL_1"
L44_1 = "The Gauntlet, hmm... How amusing, turning mock battles into entertainment. Should the opportunity arise, shall we test our wits as strategists? I must say, I find bold opening strategies quite compelling."
L42_1[1] = L43_1
L42_1[2] = L44_1
L43_1 = {}
L44_1 = "AB_UI_UNIT_VOICE_OPR_GRACE@AB_UI_UNIT_VOICE_OPR_GRACE_LOBBY_TOUCH_NORMAL_2"
L45_1 = "A lady of a Count's house is trained in more disciplines than other nobles. Etiquette, strategy, martial arts, aesthetics... the list goes on. But bringing joy to a partner as a wife? For me, that's the easy part."
L43_1[1] = L44_1
L43_1[2] = L45_1
L44_1 = {}
L45_1 = "AB_UI_UNIT_VOICE_OPR_GRACE@AB_UI_UNIT_VOICE_OPR_GRACE_LOBBY_TOUCH_NORMAL_3"
L46_1 = "The Empire's Unique Gears are handed down to the heirs of noble families, preserving their legacy. For example... hmm? Curious about the armillary sphere I'm sitting on? That's a secret. The Guide must maintain a sense of mystery, after all."
L44_1[1] = L45_1
L44_1[2] = L46_1
L45_1 = {}
L46_1 = "AB_UI_UNIT_VOICE_OPR_GRACE@AB_UI_UNIT_VOICE_OPR_GRACE_LOBBY_TOUCH_NORMAL_4"
L47_1 = "According to the stars, you're destined to be chased by something. It's surely tied to a bond from your past and also to your bloodline. You disagree? I'll admit. I don't actually know how to read fortunes."
L45_1[1] = L46_1
L45_1[2] = L47_1
L46_1 = {}
L47_1 = "AB_UI_UNIT_VOICE_OPR_GRACE@AB_UI_UNIT_VOICE_OPR_GRACE_SQUAD_ENTER"
L48_1 = "This starlight will shine upon your path ahead."
L46_1[1] = L47_1
L46_1[2] = L48_1
L47_1 = {}
L48_1 = "AB_UI_UNIT_VOICE_OPR_GRACE@AB_UI_UNIT_VOICE_OPR_GRACE_GROWTH_SKILL"
L49_1 = "Indeed, my thirst for knowledge burns bright."
L47_1[1] = L48_1
L47_1[2] = L49_1
L48_1 = {}
L49_1 = "AB_UI_UNIT_VOICE_OPR_GRACE@AB_UI_UNIT_VOICE_OPR_GRACE_FIELD_READY"
L50_1 = "As the Guide, I'll be watching over the path you carve among the stars."
L48_1[1] = L49_1
L48_1[2] = L50_1
L49_1 = {}
L50_1 = "AB_UI_UNIT_VOICE_OPR_GRACE@AB_UI_UNIT_VOICE_OPR_GRACE_BULLET_LACK"
L51_1 = "Take heed. Without rations, no soldier can give their all."
L49_1[1] = L50_1
L49_1[2] = L51_1
L50_1 = {}
L51_1 = "AB_UI_UNIT_VOICE_OPR_GRACE@AB_UI_UNIT_VOICE_OPR_GRACE_BULLET_FILL"
L52_1 = "Now, it's time to move forward once more."
L50_1[1] = L51_1
